BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260406-tax-year-start@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260407
SUMMARY:2026/27 tax year begins
DESCRIPTION:The UK 2026/27 tax year begins. Start a clean set of sole trader business records.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260406-mtd-income-tax-start@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260407
SUMMARY:Making Tax Digital for Income Tax starts for some sole traders
DESCRIPTION:Applies only if you meet the MTD for Income Tax conditions, including the relevant qualifying income threshold and Self Assessment status. Check GOV.UK/HMRC guidance.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260731-payment-on-account@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260801
SUMMARY:Self Assessment second payment on account
DESCRIPTION:Second payment on account due, where relevant. Check your HMRC online account or Self Assessment statement.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20260807-mtd-quarterly-update-1@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260807
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260808
SUMMARY:MTD quarterly update deadline
DESCRIPTION:First Making Tax Digital for Income Tax quarterly update deadline for users in the regime from April 2026.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261005-self-assessment-notification@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:Tell HMRC if you need to complete a tax return
DESCRIPTION:Deadline to tell HMRC you need to complete a Self Assessment tax return for the previous tax year, where this applies.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261031-paper-self-assessment@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Paper Self Assessment filing deadline
DESCRIPTION:HMRC must receive paper Self Assessment tax returns by this date. Applies only if filing on paper.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261107-mtd-quarterly-update-2@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
SUMMARY:MTD quarterly update deadline
DESCRIPTION:Second Making Tax Digital for Income Tax quarterly update deadline for users in the regime from April 2026.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20261230-paye-tax-code-deadline@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261230
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261231
SUMMARY:Self Assessment PAYE tax code collection deadline
DESCRIPTION:Online filing deadline if you want eligible Self Assessment tax collected through your PAYE tax code.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20270131-online-self-assessment@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270131
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270201
SUMMARY:Self Assessment online filing and payment deadline
DESCRIPTION:Online filing and payment deadline for the 2025/26 Self Assessment tax return. Balancing payment and first payment on account may also be due.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20270207-mtd-quarterly-update-3@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270208
SUMMARY:MTD quarterly update deadline
DESCRIPTION:Third Making Tax Digital for Income Tax quarterly update deadline for users in the regime from April 2026.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20270406-tax-year-start@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270407
SUMMARY:2027/28 tax year begins
DESCRIPTION:The UK 2027/28 tax year begins. MTD for Income Tax expands to some people above the next qualifying income threshold.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20270507-mtd-quarterly-update-4@soletraderbasics.com
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270507
